      · exact (Ex.okBnd_sub hs B x h1b (by simpa [hn] using h2b)).1
      · exact (Ex.okBnd_sub hs B y h1b (by simpa [hn] using h2b)).1
    · show (if (Ex.sub σ c).eval s < 0 then _ else _)
